00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.630
There's a lot of sort of milestones that will
be part of the twenty, twenty two midterm

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.630
elections.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:27.499
First of all, these will be the first midterms
after the removal of Donald Trump.

00:00:27.499 --> 00:00:31.479
In many ways, Donald Trump was sort of a crossing
of the Rubicon.

00:00:31.479 --> 00:00:35.900
It was a before and after that, we will all
remember in American politics.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:41.200
And so now that Trump has been removed, is
in the process of being removed, I believe

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.600
that there is some uncertainty as to what
we would expect in the first non Trump era

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.780
midterms.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:52.930
Number two, twenty twenty two will be the
first election with the newly drawn districts

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.360
